"blocks": [
[
"p",
"**Scenario.** A stock code is two letters then three digits. The letters must be `BL`, `FS`, `HJ` or `PX`. A method must let the user enter a stock code and keep asking until it is valid."
],
[
"p",
"**Given.**"
],
[
"code",
[
"public static string enterStockCode()"
]
],
[
"p",
"The header is written for you."
],
[
"p",
"**Your task.**"
],
[
"tasks",
[
"Declare a new `string` called `stockCode` and a new `bool` called `ok`.",
"Use a `do … while` loop that runs until `ok` is `true`.",
"Inside the loop, set `ok` to `true`; prompt \"Enter the stock code: \", read the entry, change it to upper case and store it in `stockCode`.",
"If `stockCode` is not 5 characters long, set `ok` to `false`. Otherwise break it into two parts: a new `string` called `letters` holding `stockCode.Substring(0, 2)` and a new `string` called `digits` holding `stockCode.Substring(2, 3)`.",
"Still inside the otherwise: if `letters` is not `\"BL\"`, `\"FS\"`, `\"HJ\"` or `\"PX\"`, set `ok` to `false`.",
"Still inside the otherwise: use a `for` loop over `digits`; if any character is not a digit, set `ok` to `false`.",
"If `ok` is `false`, print \"Error: two letters (BL, FS, HJ or PX) then three digits.\"",
"After the loop, return `stockCode`."
]
],
[
"note",
"Not needed: a class, `Main`, or the header line."
]
],
"kind": "code",
"points": [
{
"t": "Declaration, prompt and input"
},
{
"t": "The entry broken into its two parts (mark 1 of 2)"
},
{
"t": "The entry broken into its two parts (mark 2 of 2)"
},
{
"t": "Valid letters checked (mark 1 of 2)"
},
{
"t": "Valid letters checked (mark 2 of 2)"
},
{
"t": "The number checked (mark 1 of 2)"
},
{
"t": "The number checked (mark 2 of 2)"
},
{
"t": "The code returned"
}
],
"notes": [
"The scheme checks the number with `try` and the letters with `switch … goto case`; `Char.IsDigit` in a loop and one `if` earn the same marks."
],
"code": [
"public static string enterStockCode()",
"{",
"    string stockCode;",
"    bool ok;",
"    do",
"    {",
"        ok = true;",
"        Console.Write(\"Enter the stock code: \");",
"        stockCode = Console.ReadLine().ToUpper();",
"        if (stockCode.Length != 5)",
"        {",
"            ok = false;",
"        }",
"        else",
"        {",
"            string letters = stockCode.Substring(0, 2);",
"            string digits = stockCode.Substring(2, 3);",
"            if (letters != \"BL\" && letters != \"FS\" && letters != \"HJ\" && letters != \"PX\")",
"            {",
"                ok = false;",
"            }",
"            for (int i = 0; i < digits.Length; i++)",
"            {",
"                if (!Char.IsDigit(digits[i]))",
"                {",
"                    ok = false;",
"                }",
"            }",
"        }",
"        if (!ok)",
"        {",
"            Console.WriteLine(\"Error: two letters (BL, FS, HJ or PX) then three digits.\");",
"        }",
"    } while (!ok);",
"    return stockCode;",
"}"
],
